open Red Team/Kerberoasting.md
focus
shot ai-empty

nokey
shot ai-no-key

scenario streaming
send Summarize the sections of this note
wait 1600
toggle 1 0
wait 300
shot ai-streaming
stop
wait 200
newconv

scenario answer
send Summarize this note and suggest a better frontmatter
settle
wait 300
shot ai-answer
newconv

scenario tools
send Which notes talk about this technique?
settle
toggle 1 1
wait 200
shot ai-tools
newconv

scenario write
send Add a short detection section to this note
wait 1800
shot ai-confirm-write
apply
settle
wait 200
shot ai-confirm-applied
newconv

select Any domain user can request a service ticket for an account that has a service principal name.
focus
type @Acc
wait 300
key enter
wait 300
type @Dia
wait 300
shot ai-context
key escape
menu actions
wait 200
shot ai-actions
menu none
menu models
wait 200
shot ai-models
menu none

scenario error-key
